# Byte-transparency policy.
#
# The data deposit is shipped exactly as the authors' verified package: no line
# ending, encoding or whitespace conversion of any kind. The integrity manifests
# (deposit/08_qc/checksums_sha256.txt) record SHA-256 of those exact bytes, so
# git must never rewrite them: with `-text` the blob equals the working-tree file
# on every platform, and `sha256sum -c 08_qc/checksums_sha256.txt` passes on a
# fresh clone under Windows, macOS and Linux alike.
* -text
